      "content": "To change the hotkey for the **Smart Composer** plugin, follow these steps:\n\n1.  Open **Settings** (gear icon or `Ctrl+,`).\n2.  Navigate to the **Hotkeys** tab in the sidebar.\n3.  Search for \"Smart Composer\" in the search bar.\n4.  Locate the command you want to trigger (e.g., *Smart Composer: Open Composer*).\n5.  Click the **plus icon** (or the existing hotkey) to assign your preferred key combination.",
